+issueNumber: MDL-89768
+notes:
+  mod_wiki:
+    - message: >-
+        The external function `mod_wiki_new_page` now requires the
+        `mod/wiki:createpage` capability. The external function
+        `mod_wiki_get_subwikis` now returns a new `cancreatepages` field per
+        subwiki, indicating whether the current user can create new pages in it.
+      type: changed
